 policies, resource permissions and HTTP route authorization.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/platform/administration/access-control",{"_98":457},"platform/administration/access-control.mdx",{"_74":459,"_81":91,"_76":460,"_85":461,"_94":-7,"_12":462,"_96":463},"en:platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx","Audit logs","Understand which audit events Lamassu generates and how to turn them into a durable trail.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/platform/administration/audit-logs",{"_98":464},"platform/administration/audit-logs.mdx",{"_74":466,"_81":91,"_76":467,"_85":468,"_94":-7,"_12":469,"_96":470},"en:platform/administration/alerts.mdx","Alerts and subscriptions","Send PKI events to people and external systems.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/platform/administration/alerts",{"_98":471},"platform/administration/alerts.mdx","en:platform/administration",{"_229":474},"platform/administration/meta.json","en:platform",{"_229":477},"platform/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/lamassu.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/lamassu.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_81":82,"_76":407,"_83":30,"_84":-7,"_85":480,"_87":-7,"_78":481,"_74":546,"_96":547,"_94":549},"Run Lamassu in your environment",[482,489,492,498,505,512,519,522,529,532,539],{"_74":483,"_81":91,"_76":484,"_85":485,"_94":-7,"_12":486,"_96":487},"en:deployment/overview.mdx","Deploy Lamassu","Choose the operating model that fits your infrastructure and control requirements.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/deployment/overview",{"_98":488},"deployment/overview.mdx",{"_74":490,"_81":118,"_94":-7,"_76":491},"en:_12","Kubernetes self-managed",{"_74":493,"_81":91,"_76":491,"_85":494,"_94":-7,"_12":495,"_96":496},"en:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Choose an installation workflow and network architecture for Lamassu on your Kubernetes cluster.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/deployment/self-hosted/ove